      "uid": "zhcn:aa84f76162a8ffd0c1e515f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我身为训练员，难道就不能为她做点什么吗？\n照她的说法，似乎“只有她能跟她自己比肩”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4169768ca5729470a829c66e95d4ab85acbfdc37c03c735b0ba193e953151a76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
