      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你就在那个贵宾席看我华丽赢得比赛吧。\n那么比赛开始，首先是……“摆姿势对决”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86b6c7c5e65bef16018cb03b5eb672f8a4bac4fd1e8f3a2ce0114e5a32f9e6b",
